# The walkie transcript's speech runtime (moonshine-voice; docs/VOICE_CALLS.md C-3.11-9) in a minified build with calls.
# Its native half binds `ai.moonshine.voice.JNI`'s methods by name and builds `Transcript`, `TranscriptLine` and their
# fields itself (and reads `TranscriberOption`'s), so renaming or dropping any of them fails inside native code, not in a
# test. The AAR ships no consumer rules; the package is pinned whole.
-keep class ai.moonshine.voice.** { *; }
